<title>ITALY: TABLE-Italian cities CPI release dates July-Dec.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Italian cities CPI release dates July-Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's national statistics institute Istat said the country's 11 sample cities will publish their preliminary CPI data as set out in the following calendar.</p>
<p>	     JULY	AUG     SEPT	OCT     NOV	DEC</p>
<p> TURIN	22	  21	23	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> MILAN	21	  21	23	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> GENOA	22	  21	23	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> VENICE     21	  21	22	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> TRIESTE    21	  21	22	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> BOLOGNA    22	  21	22	  21	20	 22</p>
<p> FLORENCE   22	  22	23	  22	21	 22</p>
<p> PERUGIA    21	  21	22	  22	20	 22</p>
<p> NAPLES     21	  21	23	  22	21	 22</p>
<p> BARI	 22	  22	22	  21	21	 22</p>
<p> PALERMO    22	  22	23	  21	20	 22</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
